  "final_text": "**Disposition:** ESCALATE, confidence 0.78. A human analyst still has to decide. The proposal is on file as case C-A-261006-0006.\n\n**Facts that drove it:**\n1. The trader placed one BUY limit of 38,461 (15.7x top-5 depth, 2 ticks off the touch, about 77x the typical order size of 500). It had no fills, no other-side resting orders and no cancels on the other side. The whole order was cancelled.\n2. A SELL market order of 1,423 filled at 9997 and 9996 about 2.5 seconds after the BUY was placed. The BUY was cancelled 360 ms after that sell.\n3. The price moved 0.5 tick in the trader's favour. After the cancel it reverted 1.0 tick. No news, risk event, market-making registration or parent order explains the order.\n\nI did not propose DRAFT_STOR because the cycle occurred once in the session and the trader has no prior alerts.\n\n**What would change my mind:** Evidence that the 38,461 BUY was a genuine client or parent order, or that the SELL was an earlier hedge unrelated to the bid's price effect.",
